        "title": "Aniu ringhpui tingmik",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Aniu ringhpui tingmik manpukhou,",
            "Kanloumeipu Poubauhmei ta ai houpuni;",
            "Khou8#@ ai neihlamei tuai lak khe,",
            "Kalun tingkau mun kumna pwang puni e.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He ringmei thingbang lim khou 8#@,",
            "Tingkaumei gwai neihlana pwai;",
            "Mban thai puni hei khou 8#@,",
            "Israel chingbut than bam khou.",
            "",
            "2. Namdaih pang kalang bam sini,",
            "Hei khou 8#@ lungh rianramei 8#@ nai sini;",
            "Tarou khoou jeih hangmei rui jianmei,",
            "Ntamh puni e hei kndih hei khou hei.",
            "",
            "3. Kumna tat dikho Zion nah gwai,",
            "Katik kagun daihmei ram8#@ nagwang the;",
            "Ntao kabna rianra bam sini,",
            "Akhang neihlamei tingkauh ram 8#@ nai e.",
            "",
            "4. Kumna gaimei namdaih tang pukhou,",
            "Kandih rianra meihei ning dat lak khe;",
            "Laujiu nah le Gwang daimei ram 8#@,",
            "Jaojianmei le neihlamei tiloumei pu."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
